@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@customerToken = demo-customer-a
@merchantToken = demo-merchant-a
@orderId = 1

### 准备：应用建表后执行 scripts/merchant-demo.sql 和 scripts/order-query-demo.sql
### 客户甲归属 301；下单后将返回的 data.orderIds[0] 填入上方 orderId

### 客户下单：服务端从可信身份和商品记录确定 customerId、merchantId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consumer/orders/place
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {"merchantProductId": 101, "quantity": 2},
    {"merchantProductId": 201, "quantity": 1}
  ]
}

### 查询本人订单及成交明细：data.order 和 data.items
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consumer/orders/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId": {{orderId}}}

### 对应商家查询同一张订单及成交明细
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/orders/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId": {{orderId}}}

### 请求体不能指定客户归属：400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consumer/orders/place
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": 302, "items": [{"merchantProductId": 101, "quantity": 1}]}

### 通用订单创建关闭：404 ENTITY_NOT_EXPOSED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/create
Content-Type: application/json

{}
